# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend negations
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Python `lib/` and `.env.*` patterns above are broader than intended and
# must not hide frontend source. (Additive-only, per FRONTEND_SPEC §6.)
!frontend/src/lib/
!frontend/.env.live.example
